  {"id": "core:encounter/sallow_king", "place": "core:poi/sallow_king",
   "notes": "sallowjaw ambush from the water inside the ring; a moral choice with reputation cost. They lie in the pool under the King's roots and come up at whoever walks into the ring; the reedfolk feed them so they nest nowhere else, and the Reed Council hears of every one the player kills here. Walking back out of the ring costs nothing.",
